# The runtime image needs the engine modules and nothing else. Keeping the context narrow also makes it
# impossible to bake a local config.json (which holds a payout address) or a stray tarball into the image.
*
!pool.py
!build_coinbase.py
!zcash_v6.py
!equihash_verify.py
!pool_selftest_submit.py
!config.example.json
!Dockerfile
